msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫............"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫…………"

#: scenario:scenario_3DEE7AD6_107A_4537_8E81_568624737ADD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 630162b70edc42ee813b95dd49be109448f289376d4ca16cfa0bc337f1bf1b07
#. default-sha256: 04abff308ecad6f639b5d33efc80d1fe48f7e28f53ed2c2cddc91a3fe90a39c1
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3DEE7AD6_107A_4537_8E81_568624737ADD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Now, now, Nellie.⟪k:1⟫You love the theatre, so don’t look so cross."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫喂，⟪k:1⟫我说奈莉啊。⟪k:2⟫干嘛一脸厌烦的样子？⟪k:3⟫难得我们来看你中意的话剧。"

#: scenario:scenario_265CFEC0_5E71_47F9_B9A3_6E01D0CC0A2E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78c6e3552be7b7cd4b28c39ab43b2d3fb1ddbade79df60067028ecad995aa991
#. default-sha256: 60215c43b33f77132f4d411c7b9aabe4464b0af436c0890fe304182362e71f7b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_265CFEC0_5E71_47F9_B9A3_6E01D0CC0A2E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hmph."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……哼！"

#: scenario:scenario_2F0690F5_B04D_499F_B67D_F42C33A29F63
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9fcc8c2505b1cc487896122aeb482469613723dcc3163a2671941408adcfce38
#. default-sha256: c3148d42334914a32b507b40f4a76f3f51976e782e7027b1cbeda805c1a758a2
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2F0690F5_B04D_499F_B67D_F42C33A29F63"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nellie was out with a man other than her brother that evening—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a rare sight indeed. "
"⟪k:3⟫And she was quite clearly in a foul mood."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫这天，⟪k:1⟫奈莉很少见的，⟪k:2⟫陪着兄长以外的男性出了门。⟪k:3⟫但正如您所见，⟪k:4⟫她看上去并不"
"快乐。"

#: scenario:scenario_65760D68_8157_4380_A1FD_C7D9499A5EE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 05a0c8e2aba83c6093e2d7e49a0c2f60c86ffa22ed5a713cc367d890748f0395
#. default-sha256: 4c62e639bf894f7db190099e62256fa2221c9fa5b785763568cc9c857c6f4f59
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_65760D68_8157_4380_A1FD_C7D9499A5EE6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(I will ⟪k:1⟫not⟪k:2⟫ stand for this...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That I should have to marry a man as "
"disagreeable as Arthur!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫It’s unthinkable!)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（我绝对不会承认。⟪k:1⟫婚约者……⟪k:2⟫竟然是最令人讨厌的亚瑟！）"

#: scenario:scenario_B3289336_18B3_49E0_B92B_E9704C56BF7C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e6c13ae7199f1f4d225ca11ec168d969c1690abf019c0650149c3b33704a83e
#. default-sha256: 60591a0015fbad51534ea8edfa98e342924cdfe23ea76f52dd1db520fdbb4f4c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B3289336_18B3_49E0_B92B_E9704C56BF7C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The young man at her side was Nellie’s fiancé, selected by her parents."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫在她身边的男性，⟪k:1⟫正是奈莉的父母替她挑选的未婚夫。"

#: scenario:scenario_2F332995_B0A8_4013_B749_FE106936CB7E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90d3f394585c232563769292dc384bd7b0bdb14557a0342a86f5844e7c78e63a
#. default-sha256: 287a85a35a39f1002beb627669b12294907c5e4357411f387b91a2c8a5a07412
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2F332995_B0A8_4013_B749_FE106936CB7E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫On any other occasion, she would have snubbed an invitation from any man who was not Mell, "
"but she had little say in this matter."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫换做平时的话，⟪k:1⟫奈莉一定会严词拒绝男性的邀请。⟪k:2⟫但这次她却没能违抗……"

#: scenario:scenario_7B4E434A_609F_4B9C_A5EE_816B096EBA14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 729a50343052d3511eab5fd0c3ec1f8949560e63f4a89e373d9bce4579062bc2
#. default-sha256: 82c94ae6be10e6ca10446618bcfb8cadb06c0bf3f0326f0ee0720d46f9f441a9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7B4E434A_609F_4B9C_A5EE_816B096EBA14"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was, for lack of a better word, ⟪k:1⟫forced⟪k:2⟫ to go out with him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫夫人和老爷几乎是用强迫的手段，⟪k:1⟫逼着奈莉赴约。"

#: scenario:scenario_981EEAD6_A7DA_43EC_8AED_E0D04DBBEEB9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a849063ee2797d7b73b7307e4ec2c7ac43fd8c9b93762ca6aee0797dee18ead8
#. default-sha256: 3a51db8899841ffad6d37f93ca34920a1cb2a210334b7c4e91d7a2609c006ae0
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_981EEAD6_A7DA_43EC_8AED_E0D04DBBEEB9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And oh, how furiously she had fought against it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫也因此，⟪k:1⟫那时的奈莉比往常更加气急败坏。"

#: scenario:scenario_A3769533_FCFB_4D4E_85A6_56B7C5565642
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f885d8711d18017db17f43e92533843abb404f79171f84ca347400feeceb4b4
#. default-sha256: 765bfe2b1e8f9b9b5fb2205e3e5b078958b385fb114c43c521e7e9aaad7e1345
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A3769533_FCFB_4D4E_85A6_56B7C5565642"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She had shoved aside the abigail trying to fasten her corset, locked herself in her room, "
"and sobbed for quite some time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫她用力地推开为她束腰的女仆，⟪k:1⟫孤独无助地站在房间的中央，⟪k:2⟫泣不成声。"

#: scenario:scenario_1B9656D9_5A1E_4E60_B4B2_337DB9F43FF7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 27e7098072cd3f0e8bc9e1dd7750d47789ca3dfcc5882d484762b462754fa380
#. default-sha256: a36f3eb67c8bf7f15a35015b03af9943a4126b97800a3888e168ee9b2d7629b7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1B9656D9_5A1E_4E60_B4B2_337DB9F43FF7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It required the combined efforts of several of us to get her ready and out the door for her "
"date."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但无视着她的嚎哭，⟪k:1⟫借助数人之力帮她完成更衣。⟪k:2⟫迫使她……⟪k:3⟫与婚约者赴约。"

#: scenario:scenario_078FE7B8_6C56_4766_8BED_7CF3038AAEF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5978ad7965d67563e82070ab57274cdbcef87b3868f8c90983c7d6de9d3a5930
#. default-sha256: 465262f95596a4f6f84ef48245a0941494bc8f03340d022710e97142940568e6
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_078FE7B8_6C56_4766_8BED_7CF3038AAEF0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Come now, you should at least ⟪k:4⟫pretend⟪k:5⟫ you’re enjoying yourself.⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫Or do you want people to think we don’t get along?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫我说啊……⟪k:4⟫如果你一直板着脸，⟪k:5⟫我也很头疼啊。⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫别人一定会以为我们"
"不够亲密，⟪k:8⟫对吧？"

#: scenario:scenario_24B6A010_ADAA_4375_8A4F_BE6D161702D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5c85b66ada086192e1e9bc11b2ea4b4156fb3793162d628643817a41c48ff7c
#. default-sha256: fa5299aa717f3de2e3ffa83ac2ba587a952f99558125d97ef588831f05cc2880
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_24B6A010_ADAA_4375_8A4F_BE6D161702D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Do⟪k:3⟫ we get along?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫事实是，⟪k:2⟫我们本来就不亲密。"

#: scenario:scenario_150145E6_1717_40BB_B084_B1238714E878
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6602aa1f41e6c7ea5b8af592406e245c37d7229fd8ebaffe499eb733432d3868
#. default-sha256: cb45aa4c6fa6a913bef139903adf950dffd8621384852f1910704b457c1a780b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_150145E6_1717_40BB_B084_B1238714E878"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Well... ⟪k:3⟫I want to, for what it’s worth."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫哎呀哎呀……⟪k:3⟫我可是真心诚意，想和你更加热络一点的……"

#: scenario:scenario_247AAE0A_3603_4E14_AEB6_5526CAE6D447
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0622bc3df84abbf48f640f9e60897c200b9010bff7d4853014530ec6dcf19532
#. default-sha256: 75b982e4e72c27fbffa3c28a386de5fe9c8c9341891abe9c3e0d70dce29d4f0c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_247AAE0A_3603_4E14_AEB6_5526CAE6D447"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What it’s “worth” to you is my ⟪k:2⟫name⟪k:3⟫, not me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫你想热络的，⟪k:2⟫不是奈莉，⟪k:3⟫而是我家的地位和门第吧？"

#: scenario:scenario_D633889E_04E6_4147_BE25_F57BD22D608F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a1b2e12c6b8a682bf7e3a543bd60a075b2e29cc2831cb23d2cad090cf8296d57
#. default-sha256: 66a19275e928731c3098a6094756fbe2e603813bb8692ec0d1beaed87f6864b8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D633889E_04E6_4147_BE25_F57BD22D608F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Are you really going to be like that?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I went out of my way to take you to "
"your favorite play.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫The least you could do is be a little kinder to me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫为什么要说这种话？⟪k:3⟫我也难得陪你看一次话剧，⟪k:4⟫稍微高兴一点嘛。"

#: scenario:scenario_F0AEB14C_70D5_4B18_8AD9_F79F58B6C9C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ffd56126bbb39398101f40b055397cd16126ccf23f8fbea7b5c88a9406f6d2d
#. default-sha256: fca1d696476722096c6eead12bb5096eb67cf2978b8fe49e68e299f5b59d6c9a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F0AEB14C_70D5_4B18_8AD9_F79F58B6C9C8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What was it called again... ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Romeo and Juliet⟪k:3⟫?⟪k:4⟫It’s been running for six "
"or seven years now."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这出剧目……⟪k:1⟫是叫「罗密欧与朱丽叶」吧，这已经是连续第六还是第七年公演了。"

#: scenario:scenario_6BA47F48_0529_4CCA_AD27_7CADA721BB07
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c79f181b58e7fce88b01249786f52a3a2214463bf0c0914cb3c2559b24075135
#. default-sha256: 78007010cee7ba41f356ba6ca6ad841fd86b17691f8598fb014427ba92c02f2f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6BA47F48_0529_4CCA_AD27_7CADA721BB07"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A family like yours or mine could pay to have a brand new script written."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫如果凭借你我家族的名望，⟪k:1⟫明明可以迫使这个剧作家创作新的作品。"

#: scenario:scenario_30713950_AE46_4D34_9ECA_C74882F16FDE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e734ca4c28bc6fd0b42036051428ba7ff08685160f4c90f5743594c31eb9f330
#. default-sha256: 91f1b19cf9a4420520e73392a6b19f2de43110c4ab7c63c3829ca5a96541befa
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_30713950_AE46_4D34_9ECA_C74882F16FDE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So why should we have to see an old play at a theatre full of ⟪k:1⟫commoners⟪k:2⟫? ⟪k:3⟫It "
"may be private, but even so... ⟪k:4⟫Haah... ⟪k:5⟫I would rather just have a show put on at my "
"estate—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫而且更滑稽的是，⟪k:1⟫说什么私人设立的剧院，⟪k:2⟫来看剧的也不过是一些中产阶级……⟪k:3⟫啊啊——"
"⟪k:4⟫要看话剧的话，⟪k:5⟫还不如直接来我家——"

#: scenario:scenario_3D9E56C0_A1B7_44EC_AD7A_FB63A51C5339
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea204f2b65d37cb485fb5de64e952269b79baa281faf09c43b41966b284bbc74
#. default-sha256: ee23da7b7db30360b882fe73fe28f170642a01c24bc33436857030b4b415933a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3D9E56C0_A1B7_44EC_AD7A_FB63A51C5339"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Stop talking already!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫——吵死了啊！"

#: scenario:scenario_F8B95437_8DF9_4401_923C_9F25D9E5F7D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3cc1fc4e458db5e9c527d0c577e1e969cfaf90ed43f80cab1c84e80b6c6bcb0e
#. default-sha256: 56b651dd7aa7ed1729539c174fa1a032372e138afcfcb1ba32d69eecd0f4c662
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F8B95437_8DF9_4401_923C_9F25D9E5F7D5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why should I— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Why should I have to marry someone like you?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I have "
"ab-⟪k:6⟫so-⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫lutely⟪k:9⟫ no desire to marry you!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫像你这样的……⟪k:2⟫像你这样的家伙，⟪k:3⟫为什么奈莉非得嫁给你不可！？⟪k:4⟫奈莉绝对，⟪k:5⟫绝"
"——对不要！"

#: scenario:scenario_D09A1D64_2C74_4796_8952_7D1C3A7D3431
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2a7a5442a967cbed412354ff9c0209dd617b026c06f0654e019155f90cf780b
#. default-sha256: 054c38af5d5edbdff922dd3745418507842d98e4b8f9210fd3a5af03834bf07f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D09A1D64_2C74_4796_8952_7D1C3A7D3431"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Whatever it takes, I ⟪k:1⟫will⟪k:2⟫ put a stop to this!⟪k:3⟫I’ll talk to Father as many "
"times as I must!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫无论如何我都要解除婚约！⟪k:1⟫不管抗议多少次！⟪k:2⟫我都要说服父亲大人！"

#: scenario:scenario_BD0D5A62_3C7D_4C7E_91EB_857CAB409587
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9880f738fb970a82328b54435fa566e339018e1b2158dcc507dc1442eef0b764
#. default-sha256: 36d59209188944025bc7481854e5e8e22a8f0d5f30c18c30a06efccd039326b9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BD0D5A62_3C7D_4C7E_91EB_857CAB409587"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Please, don’t make such a scene. It’s shameful.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫There are people around; "
"remember, you represent your family."
msgstr ""
